GEN in G1
=========
Adapted from src/gen.c at https://github.com/semierendonmez-commits/bitbox-mk2-semi/tree/b7dfa9ab815342914ade82585756bd701b0c99d7 . See GEN-DONOR-LICENSE.txt (MIT, portkit contributors). The BBCut, Acid and Turing sections originate in the author's Apache-2.0 OpenTracker fork (https://github.com/semierendonmez-commits/polyend-tracker-re-semi). See GEN-APACHE-2.0.txt. Upstream credits Nick Collins / BBenCut, TB-3PO, and Music Thing Turing Machine. G1 adapts storage, queue scheduling, lifecycle, native parameter registration and pad/Tools screens for U3.

